[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3089142333","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108736#issuecomment-3089142333","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108736","id":3089142333,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64IJI9","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-18T11:21:34Z","updated_at":"2025-07-18T11:21:34Z","body":"Maybe the same reason as #108362. I'm curious if such devices are recognized by Linux as joypads or gamepads. Can you provide the corresponding entry for the device in `/proc/bus/input/devices`? ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3089142333/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3090580227","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108736#issuecomment-3090580227","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108736","id":3090580227,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64NoMD","user":{"login":"super-dupers","id":221397913,"node_id":"U_kgDODTJDmQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/221397913?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers","html_url":"https://github.com/super-dupers","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-18T20:00:13Z","updated_at":"2025-07-18T20:00:13Z","body":"I can, here's the entry for the Rock Band 4 Jaguar:\nI: Bus=0006 Vendor=0e6f Product=0248 Version=0100\nN: Name=\"PDP Rock Band 4 Jaguar\"\nP: Phys=gip0.0/input0\nS: Sysfs=/devices/pci0000:00/0000:00:08.1/0000:0a:00.3/usb3/3-2/3-2.3/3-2.3:1.0/gip0/gip0.0/input/input54\nU: Uniq=\nH: Handlers=event26 js2 \nB: PROP=0\nB: EV=b\nB: KEY=3ff 0 0 0 0 0 0 1c00000000000000 0 0 0 0\nB: ABS=30006\n\nThen the one for the Riffmaster:\nI: Bus=0003 Vendor=0e6f Product=024a Version=0111\nN: Name=\"Performance Designed Products PDP RiffMaster Guitar for PS4\"\nP: Phys=usb-0000:0a:00.3-2.3/input3\nS: Sysfs=/devices/pci0000:00/0000:00:08.1/0000:0a:00.3/usb3/3-2/3-2.3/3-2.3:1.3/0003:0E6F:024A.0016/input/input56\nU: Uniq=0000003007006829\nH: Handlers=event27 js3 \nB: PROP=0\nB: EV=1b\nB: KEY=3fff000000000000 0 0 0 0\nB: ABS=3003f\nB: MSC=10","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3090580227/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3090783239","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108736#issuecomment-3090783239","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108736","id":3090783239,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64OZwH","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-18T21:41:21Z","updated_at":"2025-07-18T21:42:01Z","body":"- Related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108753.\n\nAre the controllers recognized by any other native app on Linux (e.g. https://hardwaretester.com/gamepad on various web browsers)?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3090783239/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3090906021","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108736#issuecomment-3090906021","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108736","id":3090906021,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64O3ul","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-18T22:20:50Z","updated_at":"2025-07-18T22:35:41Z","body":"> I can, here's the entry for the Rock Band 4 Jaguar: \n> ...\n> B: KEY=3ff 0 0 0 0 0 0 1c00000000000000 0 0 0 0 \n> B: ABS=30006\n\nJudging by the key index, the Rock Band 4 Jaguar doesn't seem to be a typical joypad or gamepad. Missing `BTN_JOYSTICK` or `BTN_GAMEPAD` bit. You can use `evtest` to confirm this further, see [Linux Gamepad Specification](https://docs.kernel.org/input/gamepad.html#linux-gamepad-specification), [BTN_JOYSTICK](https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/c7de79e662b8681f54196c107281f1e63c26a3db/include/uapi/linux/input-event-codes.h#L365C9-L365C21) , and [BTN_GAMEPAD](https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/c7de79e662b8681f54196c107281f1e63c26a3db/include/uapi/linux/input-event-codes.h#L380). \n\n\n> H: Handlers=event26 js2\n\nTo my surprise, Linux still seems to recognize it as js, not sure why.\n\n> Then the one for the Riffmaster: \n> ...\n> B: KEY=3fff000000000000 0 0 0 0 \n> B: ABS=3003f\n\nThe Riffmaster is a typical gamepad. The reason for not being recognized may be the same as #108362. You can try the latest builds in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/actions/runs/16375173079.\n\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3090906021/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3094789375","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108736#issuecomment-3094789375","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108736","id":3094789375,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64drz_","user":{"login":"super-dupers","id":221397913,"node_id":"U_kgDODTJDmQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/221397913?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers","html_url":"https://github.com/super-dupers","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-20T20:53:44Z","updated_at":"2025-07-20T20:53:44Z","body":"> Are the controllers recognized by any other native app on Linux (e.g. https://hardwaretester.com/gamepad on various web browsers)?\n\nI can confirm that the Riffmaster works perfectly as expected on the website, but oddly enough, the Rock Band 4 Jaguar causes a crash:\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"950\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4113dfa0-7431-466c-b654-8690383e2a40\" />\n\nBoth are recognized in most other applications, however, and work as expected there.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3094789375/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3094825563","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108736#issuecomment-3094825563","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108736","id":3094825563,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64d0pb","user":{"login":"super-dupers","id":221397913,"node_id":"U_kgDODTJDmQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/221397913?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers","html_url":"https://github.com/super-dupers","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-20T22:16:03Z","updated_at":"2025-07-20T22:16:03Z","body":"> Judging by the key index, the Rock Band 4 Jaguar doesn't seem to be a typical joypad or gamepad. Missing BTN_JOYSTICK or BTN_GAMEPAD bit. You can use evtest to confirm this further, see [Linux Gamepad Specification](https://docs.kernel.org/input/gamepad.html#linux-gamepad-specification), [BTN_JOYSTICK](https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/c7de79e662b8681f54196c107281f1e63c26a3db/include/uapi/linux/input-event-codes.h#L365C9-L365C21) , and [BTN_GAMEPAD](https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/c7de79e662b8681f54196c107281f1e63c26a3db/include/uapi/linux/input-event-codes.h#L380).\n\nAfter checking with ev_test, you are completely right. The supported normal button events are BTN_SELECT, BTN_START, BTN_MODE,  ABS_Y, ABS_Z, ABS_HAT0X, and ABS_HAT0Y. Neither BTN_GAMEPAD nor BTN_JOYSTICK are supported events. Every other button event is BTN_TRIGGER_HAPPY1-10. \n\n> The Riffmaster is a typical gamepad. The reason for not being recognized may be the same as [#108362](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108362). You can try the latest builds in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/actions/runs/16375173079.\n\nThe latest build does support the Riffmaster, but the Rock Band 4 Jaguar is undetected.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3094825563/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3094868820","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108736#issuecomment-3094868820","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108736","id":3094868820,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64d_NU","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-20T23:47:23Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T00:09:23Z","body":"Currently, the Rock Band 4 Jaguar will not be recognized as a joystick.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/71a9948157dc2d5cc71fcb456c9d96656678757d/thirdparty/sdl/core/linux/SDL_evdev_capabilities.c#L111-L123\n\nAfter #108373 is merged, it may be supported in newer `systemd` versions (>= v234, see https://github.com/systemd/systemd/blob/v234/src/udev/udev-builtin-input_id.c#L201-L208). You can download a suitable build for testing from Artifacts in [checks](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108373/checks).\n\n> H: Handlers=event26 js2 \n\nThis probably means that the version already meets the requirement.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3094868820/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3239395645","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108736#issuecomment-3239395645","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108736","id":3239395645,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BFUE9","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-30T16:47:15Z","updated_at":"2025-08-30T16:47:15Z","body":"@super-dupers Hello, sorry for bothering you, may I ask if the issue is still reproducible in newer 4.5 betas, like 4.5 beta 7?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3239395645/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3240357383","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108736#issuecomment-3240357383","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108736","id":3240357383,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BI-4H","user":{"login":"super-dupers","id":221397913,"node_id":"U_kgDODTJDmQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/221397913?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers","html_url":"https://github.com/super-dupers","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/super-dupers/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-31T19:21:43Z","updated_at":"2025-08-31T19:21:43Z","body":"No worries!\nI'm sorry for not updating this when I should have, but I've discovered that the reason for the odd input types (and much of the weirdness in general) was because of a kernel driver I forgot I had installed. After editing it to use the standard gamepad events, Godot recognized it immediately (both in the beta and current stable release).\nAlso, I can confirm that the problem is fixed in the latest beta after swapping back to the unedited driver to test it.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3240357383/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3240745413","html_url":"https://github.co